        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    initial_investment = 250_000\n    ending_fund_value = 320_000\n    management_fee_rate = 0.04\n    incentive_fee_rate = 0.12\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    profit = ending_fund_value - initial_investment\n    management_fee = ending_fund_value * management_fee_rate\n    incentive_fee = profit * incentive_fee_rate\n    investor_value = ending_fund_value - management_fee - incentive_fee\n    answer = round((investor_value / initial_investment - 1) * 100, 1)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
